{"title":"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Faster)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Faster)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Another_Fast_Way)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Another Fast Way)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🔥Fast and Easy🔥)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math4All999\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math4All999</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_paixiao\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by paixiao</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical(Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A donkey suffers an attack of hiccups and the first hiccup happens at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3ec6d16359b83b15754968b8fde8a9bad18553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> one afternoon. Suppose that\nthe donkey hiccups regularly every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> seconds. At what time does the donkey’s <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b640caf462417d59208b590f634dd8de89b8a96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />th hiccup occur?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/8/db896a8d7ac59093b2cb3385c9d4d46a53ea4c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }15 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a7af7d95e8f0972ab6db2f4cabe8d33fb89a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B) }20 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a8c9681498f3e18c75ba827d0839b1184b11940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) }25 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/9/4190cdb3f3500b45771091c89ee053ae2b7606ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }30 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d2943e0d9b86674f18c9beddeb690df5c65df6f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) }35 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the donkey hiccupped the 1st hiccup at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3ec6d16359b83b15754968b8fde8a9bad18553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, it hiccupped for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2b8a125248afba1aef3dbe8466762993d92e20d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\cdot (700-1) = 3495$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" /> seconds, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b784ad3135944214ca7ecade87b8dfa3aa54f1f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> minutes and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e514b801e44080a8fa1604306b4faf0bc4745978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }15 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"214\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Faster)\">Solution 2 (Faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that the minute has already been determined.\nThe donkey hiccups once every 5 seconds, or 12 times a minute. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/a/6aa9ab5f899ba74a34aac48342e68db3b4a650a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700\\equiv 4 \\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" />, so the 700th hiccup happened on the same second as the 4th, which occurred on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/75485c98e2a504beb44f7521d676097853b6569b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(4-1)=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" />th second. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e514b801e44080a8fa1604306b4faf0bc4745978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }15 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"214\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~not_slay and HIPHOPFROG1\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Another_Fast_Way.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Another_Fast_Way)\">Solution 3 (Another Fast Way)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Another Fast Way)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b0fcccc79528695d3eb2e93f4e4bf1c2e0e64be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\cdot500=3500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" /> and then minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> seconds.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/11841c5209db8d4304da9233e4b01b33f57157b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 4:00+3500\\text{ seconds} &amp;= 4:00+3600\\text{ seconds }-100\\text{ seconds} \\\\ &amp;=4:00+1\\text{ hour }-100\\text{ seconds} \\\\ &amp;=5:00-100\\text{ seconds} \\\\ &amp;=20 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58. \\end{align*}\" width=\"460\" height=\"88\" />\nFinally, we minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> seconds giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e514b801e44080a8fa1604306b4faf0bc4745978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }15 \\text{ seconds after } 4:58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"214\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Pancakerunner2\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.94.A5Fast_and_Easy.F0.9F.94.A5.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥)\">Video Solution (🔥Fast and Easy🔥)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🔥Fast and Easy🔥)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HLuGbW2P_tA\">https://youtu.be/HLuGbW2P_tA</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI?t=310\">https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI?t=310</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math4All999\">Video Solution by Math4All999</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math4All999\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Jaybq_YT4Pk?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/Jaybq_YT4Pk?feature=shared</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_paixiao\">Video Solution by paixiao</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by paixiao\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-rjeTcs3lGA\">https://youtu.be/-rjeTcs3lGA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical.28Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical(Easy)\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Z02zOD_pnuA?si=xBbjdhyGEqWrXwiT\">https://youtu.be/Z02zOD_pnuA?si=xBbjdhyGEqWrXwiT</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B\">2022 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\